  "contentHtml": "<p style=\"text-align: left;\">중1 대상으로 과학사에서 세상을 바꾼 물질 가르치면서 반도체를 계획해두었는데<br><br>실험으로 괜찮은 것이 무엇이 있을까요?<br>일단 실무사님께 과학실에 빵판이랑 LED 등등이 있는지 여쭤는 볼건데, 이런거 외에 괜찮은 실험 무엇이 있을까요?</p><div class=\"figure-video\" data-ke-type=\"video\" data-video-url=\"https://kakaotv.daum.net/embed/player/cliplink/rvc7xonff7qlznzxqezg2n2qn@my?service=daum_cafe\" data-video-host=\"kakaotv\" data-video-play-service=\"daum_cafe\" data-video-width=\"1920\" data-video-height=\"1080\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-video-thumbnail=\"https://thumb.kakaocdn.net/dna/kamp/source/rvc7xonff7qlznzxqezg2n2qn/thumbs/2.jpg?credential=TuMuFGKUIcirOSjFzOpncbomGFEIdZWK&amp;expires=33299001433&amp;signature=vDHv0MLujG57j%2BvlJVG7Oo%2FAefA%3D&amp;ts=1742092633\" data-ke-mobile-mobilestyle=\"widthFull\" data-video-origin-width=\"1920\" data-video-origin-height=\"1080\"><iframe src=\"https://kakaotv.daum.net/embed/player/cliplink/rvc7xonff7qlznzxqezg2n2qn?service=daum_cafe&amp;f=p&amp;ptoken=eyJhbGciOiJIUzUxMiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJpZCI6InJ2Yzd4b25mZjdxbHpuenhxZXpnMm4ycW4iLCJ0aWQiOiJmNWI1YTBkZi02NTg0LTQzNDItODJkZi0yNzBjNDRhMTJiYTYiLCJhcHBfaWQiOiJkYXVtX2NhZmUiLCJleHAiOjE3ODYxODExMjV9.p-NXk4AJhrAMSI7adzqBfjW8ifX0sUq1U5-89iXD9qf4yiRqNkvnKudjKq5OjInNGHBoIgpM_bTHwYvy79pJRA&amp;autoplay=0\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1080\" frameborder=\"0\" scrolling=\"no\" allowfullscreen=\"\" allow=\"encrypted-media\"></iframe><div class=\"figcaption\"></div></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\">이런거 할 수 있으면 좋겠네요</p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->"
